          <span class="card-meta">Fifth Schedule</span>
          <h4>Schedule 5 — Administration of Scheduled Areas</h4>
          <p data-en="Governance and safeguards for Scheduled Areas and Scheduled Tribes across Indian states." data-ur="Makhsoos qabaili aur Scheduled ilaqon ka intezami dacha aur qanooni tahaffuz.">Governance and safeguards for Scheduled Areas and Scheduled Tribes across Indian states.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card const-card" data-keys="schedule 6 sixth tribal areas assam meghalaya tripura mizoram">
          <span class="card-meta">Sixth Schedule</span>
          <h4>Schedule 6 — Tribal Areas in North-East</h4>
          <p data-en="Autonomous district councils governance in Assam, Meghalaya, Tripura, and Mizoram." data-ur="Assam, Meghalaya, Tripura aur Mizoram ke khud-mukhtar tribal councils ka nizam.">Autonomous district councils governance in Assam, Meghalaya, Tripura, and Mizoram.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card const-card" data-keys="schedule 7 seventh union list state concurrent legislative subjects">
